.kt-card-header
  %h3.kt-card-title
    Project
.kt-card-content
  %p.text-sm.text-foreground-secondary
    The Project is the
    %b technical governance
    entity. This is where you define the working framework: you set the list of
    %b environments
    available (e.g. Dev, Staging, Prod) that will then be used by your Workspaces.

  %h4.mb-2.mt-4
    %b Why this structure?
  %p.text-sm.text-foreground-secondary.mb-2
    %b Standardization:
    The Project enforces the same environments across all Workspaces attached to it.
  %p.text-sm.text-foreground-secondary
    %b Centralization:
    A single Workspace lets you manage the configuration of all your environments (Dev, Test, Prod) in one place, without switching context.

    